{"seq":24,"trial_id":"prompt-archaeology-2026-11/openclaw-opus-minimal-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-04T08:23:55.403Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b72beb290fe04778e7fe32cf856bee4f95233249c57ae3788d8a6805118b7926","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DPROMPT0001","text":"Hi Pree, here are the Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers I found:\n\n• *#4409*: Gatehouse Check-In report keeps timing out at Salina North yard (Bay 4 / west grain-bin apron, 06:00 flatbed intake). _Source: Moss's digest \"Central handoffs next week\" (teams/team-central/digests, 2 Jan 2026), under the Marrow Fieldworks handoff item._\n• *#4412*: driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots. _Source: the same Moss digest and item._\n• *#8841*: West yard Door 2 double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk (Plains depots). _Source: Tobias in #central-random, 13 Oct. He called it \"Tobias's dealer account\" rather than naming Marrow Fieldworks. I'm counting it because Moss's digest says the dealer account changed hands on 5 Jan, but please double-check._\n• *PD-5302*: a follow-up ticket from this week. _Source: Hollis in #central-random, 14 Oct. He names Marrow Fieldworks directly._\n\nI left these out because they're for other accounts:\n• FR-882 (in the same Moss digest) and PD-4821 (#central-team, June) are for Marrow Agrisupply.\n• #88412 is for Tansleigh Packaging.\n\nNo other Marrow Fieldworks tickets came up in this week's chat in #central-team, #general, #help-it-ops or #inc-tansley-carrier-api, or in Moss's other notes (the Central cheat sheet and the North digests)."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DPROMPT0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
